<title>FRANCE: French August official reserves 303.69 bln Ffr.</title>
<headline>French August official reserves 303.69 bln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of France and finance ministry gave the following breakdown of offical gold and foreign exchange reserves (in billions of francs)</p>
<p>					  Aug    July</p>
<p> Total reserves		   303.690  303.524</p>
<p> Gold				 164.814  164.814</p>
<p> Ecu				   55.849   55.849</p>
<p> Foreign exchange		  63.993   63.924</p>
<p> Credits with IMF		  19.034   18.937</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
